                    <div class="column-div" style="width: 50%;"><strong>10.4. Data Security:</strong> The Agent shall implement and maintain appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect personal data against unauthorized or unlawful processing and against accidental loss, destruction, or damage, using the highest industry-standard security measures, including but not limited to robust access controls, encryption, and firewalls.</div>
