                    <div class="column-div" style="width: 50%;"><strong>10.6. Data Breach Notification:</strong> The Agent shall promptly notify the Developer of any actual or suspected personal data breach or security incident without undue delay, and shall provide all necessary assistance to the Developer in investigating and mitigating the impact of such breach or incident.</div>
